# Tradovate DEMO credentials for the FCR paper bot — EXAMPLE ONLY.
#
# Copy this file to ".env" in this directory, fill in YOUR OWN values
# locally, and never commit the filled-in file (it is git-ignored in
# spirit — check `git status` before any commit).
#
# Where these come from: your own Tradovate account —
#   Application Settings > API Access > Generate API Key
# (API access itself is an add-on subscription on a funded account;
# see Tradovate's "How Do I Get Access to the Tradovate API?" help
# article.) The key is shown ONE time only — store it in your
# password manager / local .env, nowhere else.
#
# NEVER paste these values into chat, email, a ticket, or any AI
# conversation — not with Muse, not with anyone. If a value leaks,
# revoke/regenerate the key in Tradovate immediately.
#
# These are DEMO-environment credentials for the paper bot. This
# project has no live credentials and the code refuses to trade live.

TRADOVATE_DEMO_USERNAME=
TRADOVATE_DEMO_PASSWORD=
TRADOVATE_DEMO_API_KEY=
TRADOVATE_DEMO_API_SECRET=
TRADOVATE_DEMO_CID=
